    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20159" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hălĭartus</span></b> , i,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἁλίαρτος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city of
				Bœotia near the modern village of Mazi</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 7,
				12, § 26</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Nep. Lys. 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 42,
